---
// Section rule carrying the logo's pill at -24°, so the mark shows up between sections.
---

<div class="flex items-center gap-4 pt-10 sm:pt-16" aria-hidden="true">
	<span class="h-px flex-1 bg-lp-ink/10"></span>
	<svg class="h-6 w-12 shrink-0 text-lp-accent" viewBox="0 0 46 24" fill="none">
		<rect x="6" y="5" width="34" height="14" rx="7" transform="rotate(-24 23 12)" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"></rect>
	</svg>
	<span class="h-px flex-1 bg-lp-ink/10"></span>
</div>
